# Title: ShimCache Flush
# ID: b0524451-19af-4efa-a46f-562a977f792e
# Status: stable
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-02-01
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1112
# Description: Detects actions that clear the local ShimCache and remove forensic evidence
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((CommandLine CONTAIN "rundll32" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "apphelp.dll")) AND ((CommandLine CONTAIN "ShimFlushCache" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "#250"))) OR (((CommandLine CONTAIN "rundll32" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "kernel32.dll")) AND ((CommandLine CONTAIN "BaseFlushAppcompatCache" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "#46"))))
